{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.DeltaLambdaJetOrderDegreeSelection","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.DeltaLambdaJetOrderDegreeSelection","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.DeltaLambdaTopDegreeConcentration"],"declarations":11,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.valuation_and_totalDim_do_not_determine_gradedEuler","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.valuation_and_totalDim_do_not_determine_gradedEuler","kind":"theorem","line":231,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/DeltaLambdaJetOrderDegreeSelection.lean#L231-L237","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.gradedEuler_pair","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.gradedEuler_pair","kind":"theorem","line":226,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/DeltaLambdaJetOrderDegreeSelection.lean#L226-L229","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.gradedEuler_singleton","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.gradedEuler_singleton","kind":"theorem","line":223,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/DeltaLambdaJetOrderDegreeSelection.lean#L223-L224","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.jetorder_valuation_cannot_force_single_degree","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.jetorder_valuation_cannot_force_single_degree","kind":"theorem","line":180,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/DeltaLambdaJetOrderDegreeSelection.lean#L180-L215","doc":"**THE CRUX (limitative — bean `qou-71ma`).**  There exist two graded\nassignments `single = G_λ` and `fake = H_λ` such that:\n\n  • they carry the SAME jet-order VALUATION `n(λ)` at every block (`val`) —\n    the bottom grade the GS jet-order structure supplies;\n  • they carry the SAME ungraded Wedderburn dimension `dim V_λ` at every\n    block (`dim`) — the datum the confinement SDP / `T_w` / `tr_M` read (#4570);\n  • yet their signed Euler characteristics DIFFER on every non-trivial block\n    (`differ`), with only the concentrated object equal to `Δ_λ` (`is_delta`).\n\nSince the promoted a-function supplies exactly `(valuation, ungraded dim)` and\nboth objects share BOTH, no functional of that data — in particular the GS\njet-order valuation — can distinguish, hence cannot FORCE, the single-degree\n(top-cohomology) concentration.  The concentration `H^{top}(𝓑_λ) = V_λ` is a\ngenuinely INDEPENDENT input.  This is the NEGATIVE answer to `qou-71ma`: the\njet-order valuation supplies the grade VALUE, never the single-degree\nSELECTION.  Companion (ungraded side): #4570 `sdp_cannot_force_top_degree`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.coeff_at_valuation_differs","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.coeff_at_valuation_differs","kind":"theorem","line":167,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/DeltaLambdaJetOrderDegreeSelection.lean#L167-L173","doc":"On every non-trivial block the two objects DIFFER at the valuation grade\n(`1 ≠ dim V_λ`): concentrating `dim` at `n(λ)` is not what the natural graded\nobject does. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.PartitionOf5.singleCoeff_at_valuation_eq_dim","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.PartitionOf5.singleCoeff_at_valuation_eq_dim","kind":"theorem","line":163,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/DeltaLambdaJetOrderDegreeSelection.lean#L163-L165","doc":"`G_λ` carries coefficient `dim V_λ` at the valuation degree `n(λ)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.PartitionOf5.fakeCoeff_at_valuation_eq_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.PartitionOf5.fakeCoeff_at_valuation_eq_one","kind":"theorem","line":158,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/DeltaLambdaJetOrderDegreeSelection.lean#L158-L161","doc":"`H_λ` carries coefficient `1` at the valuation degree `n(λ)` — the monic\nleading term of the fake-degree polynomial. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.PartitionOf5.same_valuation","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.PartitionOf5.same_valuation","kind":"theorem","line":145,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/DeltaLambdaJetOrderDegreeSelection.lean#L145-L147","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.PartitionOf5.fake_valuation_eq_nStat","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.PartitionOf5.fake_valuation_eq_nStat","kind":"theorem","line":142,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/DeltaLambdaJetOrderDegreeSelection.lean#L142-L143","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.PartitionOf5.single_valuation_eq_nStat","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.PartitionOf5.single_valuation_eq_nStat","kind":"theorem","line":139,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/DeltaLambdaJetOrderDegreeSelection.lean#L139-L140","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.valuation","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.valuation","kind":"def","line":128,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/DeltaLambdaJetOrderDegreeSelection.lean#L128-L130","signatureChunk":0}]}